<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; text-align: center; background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 8px; }
        .button { background: #3b82f6; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to RSCI-RC3!</h1>
        <p>Hello {{username}}, we're excited to have you join our competitive coding community.</p>
        <p>Please verify your email to unlock all features, including contests and certificates.</p>
        <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
